<title>USA: Fingerhut Cos names Wehmann its treasurer.</title>
<headline>Fingerhut Cos names Wehmann its treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fingerhut Cos Inc said Wednesday it appointed James Wehmann to the post of treasurer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the marketing company said Wehmann succeeds Robert Oberrender, who in December became chief financial officer of Metris Inc, an 83-percent-owned subsidiary of Fingerhut.</p>
<p>Wehmann was most recently assistant treasurer and acting treasurer for Fingerhut, the company said.</p>
<p>Fingerhut shares were off 3/32 Wednesday at 14-5/32.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
